# A loft that leaves along a solid's sides: the top circle of a drafted
# post lofted to a tip, set on its screen to carry the post's sides on;
# the screen, then the solid checked.
file $testdata/ui/loft_sides.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
click-entity 60000
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
twmove 320 185
twdown L 320 185
twup L 320 185
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
